<% provide(:title, 'Rhombus - About us') %>

<div class="hero-content pricing w-container">
  <h1 class="hero-h1 home-header pricing-hero">About Relay</h1>
</div>
<div class="about-relay def-content-row w-row">
  <div class="pricing-row-column-1 w-clearfix w-col w-col-7">
    <div class="def-row-content-wrapper picture-bg"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pricing-row-column-2 w-clearfix w-col w-col-5">
    <div class="def-row-content-wrapper">
      <%= image_tag('003_043.png', class: 'pricing-table-icon') %>
      <h1 class="alt first-content-section-sub-header">Customer communication software designed by humans.</h1>
      <p class="alt def-content-section-paragraph">Pricing is based on how many active customers or leads you communicate with inside Relay. No per seat pricing.
        <br>
        <br>Active customers or leads are individuals that have engaged in a two-way conversation with your business. You can also think of conversations as tickets, and you only pay for individuals your team has responded to, this way you don't pay for spam senders that message your business.
        <br>
        <br>Active customers or leads are individuals that have engaged in a two-way conversation with your business. You can also think of conversations as tickets, and you only pay for individuals your team has responded to, this way you don't pay for spam senders that message your business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
